[[b]]Chore playbook — change {{CHANGE_ID}}[[/b]][[g]] — agent-executed (ADR 0005); no spec deltas.[[/g]]

Prompt: "{{PROMPT}}"

Execute in order, in a single linear pass:

1. Replace the placeholder tasks in .doctrina/changes/{{CHANGE_ID}}/tasks.md
   with small, checkable steps; implement them, checking each box.
[[g]]   (Do it before implementing — analyze/close refuse leftover scaffold[[/g]]
[[g]]   placeholders, and `change tick` will not tick an empty box.)[[/g]]
2. Prove it (archive refuses unchecked boxes):
       [[c]]doctrina verify[[/c]]     — the project's typecheck/test/build gate
       [[c]]doctrina verify --clean[[/c]] — clean-checkout reproducibility lint
   Then check the proposal's ## Verification boxes and every task.
3. This is a chore: no spec changes. If you find yourself needing a
   spec delta, it is not a chore — reopen with [[c]]doctrina work "<prompt>"[[/c]].
4. [[c]]doctrina change apply {{CHANGE_ID}}[[/c]]  (zero deltas → flips to applied).
5. [[c]]doctrina change archive {{CHANGE_ID}}[[/c]], then [[c]]doctrina validate[[/c]].
